  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Aaron",
   "text": "I see the prescription. It's with me. It came in at 10:42, but it stopped at the insurance step.",
   "start": 44.84,
   "end": 52.02,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "user",
   "speaker": "Miles",
   "text": "Um, what did- what do you mean, uh, insurance? The app didn't say anything about insurance or anything. It just said, um, that it was processing. Did I miss something?",
   "start": 52.18,
   "end": 59.56,
   "emotions": [
    "confused"
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Aaron",
   "text": "Um, yeah, so the app message is pretty general. The claim rejected because the plan thinks that the refill is too soon. Did you by any chance have or fill another inhaler recently?",
   "start": 60.44,
   "end": 71.98,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "user",
   "speaker": "Miles",
   "text": "Um, I- I think, I think I did it, uh, last month, but I left that one in a h- hotel room and I told the doctor's office that, um, when I was asking for a, uh, for a refill.",
   "start": 73.36,
   "end": 83.52,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Aaron",
   "text": "Okay. Give me one moment.",
   "start": 84.62,
   "end": 85.78,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Aaron",
   "text": "The new prescription is valid. I'm seeing that the issue here is the payment. We can ask the insurance for a lost medication override, but they may need to speak with you.",
   "start": 89.5,
   "end": 99.3,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "user",
   "speaker": "Miles",
   "text": "Uh, is there any way you can call them right now? I'm leaving town again tomorrow morning a- and I kinda need it.",
   "start": 99.78999999999999,
   "end": 105.97999999999999,
   "emotions": [
    "concerned"
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Aaron",
   "text": "Okay. I can start it. One second. Before I do, do you need the inhaler tonight or do you have another one available with you?",
   "start": 106.02000000000001,
   "end": 112.759,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "user",
   "speaker": "Miles",
   "text": "Uh, I got, I got one at home with, um, maybe a f- a couple doses left, but I need the new one before I go on the trip.",
   "start": 113.53999999999999,
   "end": 119.1,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Aaron",
   "text": "Understood.",
   "start": 120.22,
   "end": 120.68,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Aaron",
   "text": "Let me call the plan while you're on the line. It may take a couple minutes. Okay?",
   "start": 122.12,
   "end": 126.6,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "user",
   "speaker": "Miles",
   "text": "Yeah. Thank you.",
   "start": 126.66,
   "end": 127.18,
   "emotions": []
  },
