  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Aaron",
   "text": "They approved a one-time lost medication override. I reran the claim and I'm seeing that your co-pay is $15.",
   "start": 187.549,
   "end": 195.44,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "user",
   "speaker": "Miles",
   "text": "Okay. Um, great. So is it, is it ready now?",
   "start": 196.42000000000002,
   "end": 199.64,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Aaron",
   "text": "Um, not quite yet. The pharmacist on our side still has to check it. You're next in the queue and we're looking at about 30 minutes.",
   "start": 199.72,
   "end": 208.14,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "user",
   "speaker": "Miles",
   "text": "Um, when do you guys close? It closes at, on the pharmacy it's at, um, 7:00, right? Like it closes at 7:00?",
   "start": 208.26,
   "end": 214.28,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Aaron",
   "text": "Our counter closes at 7:00 but the front store usually stays a lot open, uh, open a lot later.",
   "start": 214.32,
   "end": 219.18,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "user",
   "speaker": "Miles",
   "text": "Right. So it's, it's like, um, 6:15 now and I'm about 25 minutes away. Is that, is that, is that good? Is that fine?",
   "start": 220.38,
   "end": 228.6,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Aaron",
   "text": "Okay. Well, I think if you leave after you get the ready text you should make it. I don't wanna tell you to come before the pharmacist finishes the check though.",
   "start": 229.68,
   "end": 237.07999999999998,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "user",
   "speaker": "Miles",
   "text": "Yeah. No, no, yeah. I, I get it. Uh, can you, can you make sure it doesn't get pushed to tomorrow though? Is that possible?",
   "start": 238.07999999999998,
   "end": 243.1,
   "emotions": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "say",
   "role": "assistant",
   "speaker": "Aaron",
   "text": "I can flag- Yeah. All good. I can flag it on my end that you're traveling and waiting for it tonight. I can't skip the pharmacist's verification, but it is already in the active queue.",
   "start": 243.14,
   "end": 255.68,
   "emotions": []
  },
